{"Guest email comparisons are case-sensitive, allowing blacklisted/existing guests to slip through with different casing": 0.9797918200492859, "Authorization check uses && requiring both admin AND owner roles, which blocks legitimate admins or owners who only have one role - should use || instead": 0.9819895029067993, "Notifications use the unfiltered guests input instead of the filtered uniqueGuests list": 0.9912946820259094, "Duplicate guest emails are not removed from the input list": 0.8655070662498474, "sendAddGuestsEmails ignores disableStandardEmails flags and forwards calendarEvent unchanged, which can send emails when they're disabled": 0.990297257900238, "Invalid email banner remains visible even after user edits the email input to valid values - banner only clears when clicking Cancel or attempting to add again": 0.3443831503391266, "sendAddGuestsEmails can leak hidden notes to attendees by not respecting hideCalendarNotes setting": 0.9828445911407471, "Reassigning function parameter 'value' in MultiEmail component is a code smell": 0.0088406503200531, "Using array index as key in MultiEmail can cause issues when items are removed from the middle of the list": 0.5736382603645325, "Empty fragment <></> in MultiEmail can be simplified by restructuring the conditional": 0.038948096334934235}